# Phase 7 – Customer Support Operations Dashboard

## Overview

Phase 7 focused on creating a Tableau dashboard using Jira ticket data exported to Excel.

The dashboard provides a quick operational view of ticket volume, workload and ticket distribution.

## Dashboard Metrics

The dashboard includes:

- Total Open Tickets
- Total Resolved Tickets
- Resolved vs Open
- Tickets by Status
- Tickets by Priority
- Tickets by Support Queue
- Ticket Type Breakdown
- Business Type Breakdown

## Filters

Interactive filters were added for:

- Priority
- Support Queue
- Ticket Type

These allow the dashboard to be updated dynamically for different ticket groups.

